      "value": "I have been experiencing this issue daily, up to 4 times a day at 4 to 5 hours of the active session running. I am running on Arch with Proton-RTSP using monado. When this occurs, I stop receiving invite or join request. A reboot of the vrc client always recover the social feature for a few hours.",
